    "# ── Team-quality-scaled penalty addition ──────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "# Good teams draw noticeably more penalties than bad ones -- roughly doubling from the\n",
    "# worst to the best team in a league, consistently across leagues and seasons -- see\n",
    "# analysis/penalties/penalty_season_rate.ipynb. BASELINE_HOME_PENS/AWAY_PENS above are the\n",
